  reason="exp_blk constant/limited bits (120): the expected-block pattern is 32'hA5003C00 ^ round ^ (i*32'h00010101) per 32-bit word with round<=3 and 4 blocks; large bit ranges are structurally constant across the whole run."
waiver emmc-toggle-2 rtl/eMMC_top.sv toggle \
